# What is in this repository but must not be served.
#
# Only `tools/` was listed here, so every other non-page file in the root was deployed and
# fetchable: https://www.quantifyterminal.com/completeplan.md returned 200 and is the full
# internal account architecture plan — production status, local filesystem paths, commit
# hashes — and /build_website.py returned the generator's source. No credential is in
# either, but neither is a page and neither should be on the public web.
#
# Nothing here is linked from any page: `grep -rn '\.md' --include='*.html'` finds nothing.
# llms.txt, robots.txt and sitemap.xml are not .md and are still served.
tools/

# Internal planning and process notes.
*.md

# The stale site generator. Superseded by hand-edited HTML; kept in the repository as
# history, not as something to serve.
build_website.py

# Mockup frames from an animation whose output path came out as the literal string
# "undefined". Unreferenced by any page, and they show invented companies — a fabricated
# screenshot on the public web is worse than no screenshot.
undefined/

# Editor and tool state.
.claude/
.qodo/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
